{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-35-1","title":"Job 35:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Comparison is not to be made with God, because our good or evil cannot extend unto him. 9 Many cry in their afflictions, but are not heard for want of faith.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-2","title":"Job 35:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Thinkest. Mt 12:36,37; Lu 19:22 My. 9:17; 10:7; 16:17; 19:6,7; 27:2-6; 34:5; 40:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-3","title":"Job 35:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>what advantage. 9:21,22; 10:15; 21:15; 31:2; 34:9; Ps 73:13; Mal 3:14 If I be cleansed from my sin. or, by it more than by my sin.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-4","title":"Job 35:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>answer thee. Heb. return to thee words. thy. 34:8; Pr 13:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-5","title":"Job 35:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Look. 22:12; 25:5,6; 36:26-33; 37:1-5,22,23; 1Ki 8:27; Ps 8:3,4 Isa 40:22,23; 55:9 the clouds. 36:29; 37:16; Na 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-6","title":"Job 35:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Pr 8:36; 9:12; Jer 7:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-7","title":"Job 35:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>22:2,3; 1Ch 29:14; Ps 16:2; Pr 9:12; Ro 11:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-8","title":"Job 35:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>may hurt. Jos 7:1-5; 22:20; Ec 9:18; Jon 1:12 may profit. 42:8; Ge 12:2; 18:24-33; 19:29; Ps 106:23,30; Eze 22:30; Ac 27:24 Heb 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-9","title":"Job 35:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>they make. 24:12; 34:28; Ex 2:23; 3:7,9; Ne 5:1-5; Ps 12:5; 43:2; 55:2,3; 56:1,2 Lu 18:3-7 the arm. 40:9; Ps 10:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-10","title":"Job 35:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>none. 36:13; 1Ch 10:13,14; 2Ch 28:22,23; Isa 8:21 Where. Ec 12:1; Isa 51:13; 1Pe 4:19 my. 32:22; 36:3; Isa 54:5 who. Ps 42:8; 77:6; 119:62; 149:5; Ac 16:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-11","title":"Job 35:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>32:8; Ge 1:26; 2:7; Ps 94:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-12","title":"Job 35:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>There. Ps 18:41; Pr 1:28; Joh 9:31 because. Ps 73:6-8; 123:3,4; Isa 14:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-13","title":"Job 35:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>God. 22:22-27; 27:8,9; Pr 15:8,29; 28:9; Ec 5:1-3; Isa 1:15; Jer 11:11 Ho 7:14; 8:2,3; Mt 6:7; 20:21,22; Jas 4:3 regard. 30:20; Ps 102:17; Am 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-14","title":"Job 35:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>thou sayest. 9:11; 23:3,8-10 yet. 9:19; 19:7; Ps 77:5-10; 97:2; Isa 30:18; 54:17; Mic 7:7-9 trust. Ps 27:12-14; 37:5,6; 62:5,8; Isa 50:10; Ro 8:33,34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-15","title":"Job 35:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>because. 9:14; 13:15; Nu 20:12; Lu 1:20 he. that is, God. visited. Ps 89:32; Re 3:19 he. that is, Job. in great. 4:5; 30:15-31; Ps 88:11-16; Ho 11:8,9; Heb 12:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-35-16","title":"Job 35:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":35,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":35,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>3:1; 33:2,8-12; 34:35-37; 38:2</p>"}]}